DTSTART;TZID=Asia/Hong_Kong:20280128T235900
DTEND;TZID=Asia/Hong_Kong:20280128T235900
SUMMARY:CHECK: IEEE membership - 2028 dues are charged automatically (cover
  runs to 31 Dec 2027)
DESCRIPTION:IEEE student membership. Joined 16 Sep 2026, US$27 student rate
 , and by IEEE's own window rule (applications 16 Aug to 28 Feb are process
 ed as the FOLLOWING year's full-year membership, services start immediatel
 y) this covers the 2027 membership year through 31 December 2027. So nothi
 ng needs paying by hand - and ==automatic renewal is ON==: opted in 16 Sep
  2026 ("At the beginning of each membership year\, you will automatically 
 be charged for the next membership period")\, with IEEE emailing a reminde
 r before the card is charged. Card on file is a MasterCard\; the 16 Sep 20
 26 order was the US$27.00 student rate. Read this entry as a CHECK that th
 e 2028 charge went through and that the card is still valid - or as the mo
 ment to switch automatic renewal off in the IEEE account if you would rath
 er pay each year. If the charge fails\, cover ends 31 Dec 2027. Renew for 
 the 2028 year before 28 February 2028 to keep it continuous; after that da
 te a lapsed member rejoins under the half-year window instead. Student rat
 e is good for up to eight cumulative years. Renew at ieee.org -> Sign In -
 > Renew My Membership.
URL:https://www.ieee.org/membership/renew.html
END:VEVENT
