  AI Safety Hub\, hkaisafetyhub@user.luma-mail.com\, subject "Remind your t
 eammates to register")\, verbatim: "All your teammates must individually r
 egister to attend the hub. Please remind them to do so. Please also remind
  them to register on the Apart website. ... Only fully registered individu
 als (both Luma + Apart registered) will be permitted to enter the venue." 
