 e. Still required of him: the Apart pre-hackathon survey - without it he i
 s listed as an observer only (no prizes\, no team matching). Venue for ent
 ry: Le Bureau\, 14/F Universal Trade Centre\, 3-5A Arbuthnot Rd\, Central.
  Prizes: US$2\,000 pool plus Apart Fellowship fast track\; top HK team get
 s guaranteed entry to the 6-month Apart Fellowship.
